category":"American (New)","historical_business_count":2},{"category":"Jazz & Blues","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"RloVMlIr8kP8Sn609loBTg","review_id":"Rxm7WwQ_DL4tdrSvRsvcDg","date":"2016-08-15T23:39:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9354039430618286,"text_excerpt":"Great live jazz band. Great drinks. I love the vibe. Such a fun area to bar hop and see live music inside and on Frenchman Street. The is an upstairs area with DJ and balcony, however you can't miss the live music downstairs. We were glued. We had such a great night we ended coming back a second night. There is no cover charge and there are multiple bands that play through out the night. Our first night we only grabbed drinks. On our return visit we got drinks and oysters. We stayed through two band sets. If I wasn't flying home tonight, we would probably be heading back to see who is playing tonight. This city is full of talented individuals."},{"business_id":"RloVMlIr8kP8Sn609loBTg","review_id":"blxwUIf1GBEZe50d0Qy4HQ","date":"2019-04-09T01:51:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9344227910041809,"text_excerpt":"This is one of my favorite spots for live music on Frenchman. This is generally our first stop of the night and many nights it has been the only stop. Great jazz music downstairs and if you are in a hip hop mood no worries, just head upstairs and you will experience that nightclub feel complete with bottle service and vip booths if you wish. Haven't been here and not had a good time!"},{"business_id":"RloVMlIr8kP8Sn609loBTg","review_id":"8Hf5Nxyo0B0hIPb76r1E2g","date":"2020-02-04T01:58:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9326314330101013,"text_excerpt":"They had really good live music. We checked this place out two nights in a row because the bar was really fun and had a good vibe. Drinks are very strong. You can easily spend your entire evening here, no need to bar hop."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"RloVMlIr8kP8Sn609loBTg","photo_id":"TKWDce67icVxPADQjn-RcQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/TKWDce67icVxPADQjn-RcQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9187517166137695},{"business_id":"RloVMlIr8kP8Sn609loBTg","photo_id":"n7O_H1tNHU55ZP6Jqvmg6A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/n7O_H1tNHU55ZP6Jqvmg6A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8845974802970886},{"business_id":"RloVMlIr8kP8Sn609loBTg","photo_id":"HCr3_z2HnvhVkKntCBRoaA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/HCr3_z2HnvhVkKntCBRoaA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8461759686470032},{"business_id":"RloVMlIr8kP8Sn609loBTg","photo_id":"l2Ufst-C57xp6CD477NlAA","label":"food","i